@Gates_HostAddress = http://localhost:5069

### Корректный код
POST {{Gates_HostAddress}}/api/gates/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessCode": "Dragon7!"
}

### Нарушения правил
POST {{Gates_HostAddress}}/api/gates/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessCode": "dragon123"
}

### Три одинаковых символа подряд
POST {{Gates_HostAddress}}/api/gates/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessCode": "Aaaa7!xy7"
}

### Слишком короткий код
POST {{Gates_HostAddress}}/api/gates/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessCode": "1A!a"
}

### Пустой код
POST {{Gates_HostAddress}}/api/gates/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessCode": ""
}

### Код не передан
POST {{Gates_HostAddress}}/api/gates/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Swagger UI
GET {{Gates_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html

